window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-015.json",{"day":15,"title":"The Small Laboratory and the Public Vote","targetWords":[{"word":"dissent","gloss":"异议","context":"At the eighth public meeting about the town’s science center, the superintendent faced a room full of dissent.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"eighth","gloss":"第八","context":"At the eighth public meeting about the town’s science center, the superintendent faced a room full of dissent.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"enlist","gloss":"招募","context":"Volunteers could enlist residents for a weekend trek to the hillside garden, where a lily grew atop a low wall.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"err","gloss":"犯错","context":"The superintendent admitted that officials could err, and that an overdue safety review had damaged trust.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"fury","gloss":"愤怒","context":"One candidate was accused of threatening to rig a demonstration to create havoc for her opponent; the allegation itself stirred fury.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"hectic","gloss":"忙乱的","context":"The debate grew hectic during the electoral campaign.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"hospitable","gloss":"好客的","context":"A hospitable cafe owner offered ale and a local delicacy afterward, while a musician played nearby.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"idol","gloss":"偶像","context":"The center refused to make its lead scientist an idol.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"overdue","gloss":"过期的","context":"The superintendent admitted that officials could err, and that an overdue safety review had damaged trust.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"oversee","gloss":"监督","context":"Her task was to oversee a transparent process, not to treat every concerned resident as an adversary.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"patriot","gloss":"爱国者","context":"A patriot could question a public project, she said, and a scientist could wrestle with uncertainty without betraying science.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"poise","gloss":"镇定","context":"As election day approached, the mayor regained enough poise to speak without slogans.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"relentless","gloss":"不间断的","context":"Cosmetic improvements to the building could not repair a weak process, and relentless publicity would only make scrutiny more necessary.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"rig","gloss":"操纵","context":"One candidate was accused of threatening to rig a demonstration to create havoc for her opponent; the allegation itself stirred fury.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"spotlight","gloss":"公众关注","context":"A local journalist promised to keep the question in the spotlight.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"superintendent","gloss":"负责人","context":"At the eighth public meeting about the town’s science center, the superintendent faced a room full of dissent.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"trek","gloss":"徒步行程","context":"Volunteers could enlist residents for a weekend trek to the hillside garden, where a lily grew atop a low wall.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"wrestle","gloss":"苦苦应对","context":"A patriot could question a public project, she said, and a scientist could wrestle with uncertainty without betraying science.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"yearn","gloss":"渴望","context":"People might yearn for a single hero, but reliable knowledge came from collective criticism.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"adversary","gloss":"对手","context":"Her task was to oversee a transparent process, not to treat every concerned resident as an adversary.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"airborne","gloss":"空中的","context":"A blond student used a carton and a disk to model how an airborne particle moved along an arc.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"akin","gloss":"类似的","context":"Competition was akin to a test of institutions, she argued, not a license to abandon standards.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"ale","gloss":"麦芽啤酒","context":"A hospitable cafe owner offered ale and a local delicacy afterward, while a musician played nearby.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"algebra","gloss":"代数学","context":"Their teacher asked them to explain the algebra behind the model rather than rely on a cute animation.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"anew","gloss":"重新","context":"The final heading of the public report was simple: “What We Know, and What We Still Need to Test.” Under it, students could narrate their findings anew.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"apprentice","gloss":"见习的","context":"The center’s apprentice researchers proposed a modest demonstration instead of a glamorous launch.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"arc","gloss":"弧线","context":"A blond student used a carton and a disk to model how an airborne particle moved along an arc.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"atop","gloss":"在…上方","context":"Volunteers could enlist residents for a weekend trek to the hillside garden, where a lily grew atop a low wall.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"bilateral","gloss":"双边的","context":"Rumors that foreign partners would conspire to hide results nearly derailed a bilateral research agreement.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"biotechnology","gloss":"生物技术","context":"A retired engineer feared biotechnology research would turn the school into a commercial laboratory.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"blond","gloss":"金发的","context":"A blond student used a carton and a disk to model how an airborne particle moved along an arc.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"carton","gloss":"纸板箱","context":"A blond student used a carton and a disk to model how an airborne particle moved along an arc.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"conspire","gloss":"密谋","context":"Rumors that foreign partners would conspire to hide results nearly derailed a bilateral research agreement.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"cosmetic","gloss":"表面的","context":"Cosmetic improvements to the building could not repair a weak process, and relentless publicity would only make scrutiny more necessary.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"counteract","gloss":"对抗","context":"The teacher asked another to crouch beside a table to show how a barrier could counteract the flow.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"crouch","gloss":"蹲伏","context":"The teacher asked another to crouch beside a table to show how a barrier could counteract the flow.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"crumble","gloss":"瓦解","context":"Funding might crumble if the center overstated its abilities; disappointment would ensue even if the original intention was good.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"cute","gloss":"可爱的","context":"Their teacher asked them to explain the algebra behind the model rather than rely on a cute animation.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"delicacy","gloss":"佳肴","context":"A hospitable cafe owner offered ale and a local delicacy afterward, while a musician played nearby.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"disk","gloss":"圆盘","context":"A blond student used a carton and a disk to model how an airborne particle moved along an arc.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"electoral","gloss":"选举的","context":"The debate grew hectic during the electoral campaign.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"ensue","gloss":"随之而来","context":"Funding might crumble if the center overstated its abilities; disappointment would ensue even if the original intention was good.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"foe","gloss":"敌人","context":"The director refused to portray a rival as a foe.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"gleam","gloss":"光亮","context":"A gleam from the lamp made the path visible, but the experiment could not prove the safety of every real building.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"havoc","gloss":"混乱","context":"One candidate was accused of threatening to rig a demonstration to create havoc for her opponent; the allegation itself stirred fury.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"heading","gloss":"标题","context":"The final heading of the public report was simple: “What We Know, and What We Still Need to Test.” Under it, students could narrate their findings anew.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"intangible","gloss":"无形的","context":"Trust was intangible, built through repeated chances to ask awkward questions and receive an honest answer.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"lily","gloss":"百合花","context":"Volunteers could enlist residents for a weekend trek to the hillside garden, where a lily grew atop a low wall.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"malpractice","gloss":"失职违规","context":"A parent worried about malpractice if experiments crossed into medical claims.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"narrate","gloss":"叙述","context":"The final heading of the public report was simple: “What We Know, and What We Still Need to Test.” Under it, students could narrate their findings anew.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"At the eighth public meeting about the town’s science center, the superintendent faced a room full of dissent. A retired engineer feared biotechnology research would turn the school into a commercial laboratory. A parent worried about malpractice if experiments crossed into medical claims. The superintendent admitted that officials could err, and that an overdue safety review had damaged trust. Her task was to oversee a transparent process, not to treat every concerned resident as an adversary. A local journalist promised to keep the question in the spotlight.","zh":"在有关城镇科学中心的第八次公开会议上，主管面对满屋反对意见。一位退休工程师担心生物技术研究会把学校变成商业实验室。一位家长则担心，实验一旦涉及医疗宣称，会出现失职违规。主管承认，官员可能犯错，而迟迟未完成的安全审查已损害信任。她的任务是监督透明程序，而不是把每位担忧的居民当作对手。当地记者承诺持续关注这个问题。"},{"en":"The center’s apprentice researchers proposed a modest demonstration instead of a glamorous launch. A blond student used a carton and a disk to model how an airborne particle moved along an arc. The teacher asked another to crouch beside a table to show how a barrier could counteract the flow. Their teacher asked them to explain the algebra behind the model rather than rely on a cute animation. A gleam from the lamp made the path visible, but the experiment could not prove the safety of every real building.","zh":"中心的见习研究者提出用简朴演示代替华丽发布。一位金发学生利用纸箱与圆盘，模拟悬浮颗粒沿弧线运动。教师请另一位蹲在桌边，演示屏障如何抵消气流。教师要求他们解释模型背后的代数，而不是依赖可爱动画。灯光使轨迹可见，但这项实验不能证明每一栋真实建筑都安全。"},{"en":"Public education required a different kind of effort. Volunteers could enlist residents for a weekend trek to the hillside garden, where a lily grew atop a low wall. A hospitable cafe owner offered ale and a local delicacy afterward, while a musician played nearby. The center refused to make its lead scientist an idol. People might yearn for a single hero, but reliable knowledge came from collective criticism. Trust was intangible, built through repeated chances to ask awkward questions and receive an honest answer.","zh":"公众教育需要另一类努力。志愿者可以招募居民周末徒步到山坡花园，那里一株百合长在矮墙上方。热情的咖啡馆老板随后提供麦芽啤酒和地方美食，旁边还有音乐表演。中心拒绝把首席科学家塑造成偶像。人们也许渴望单一英雄，但可靠知识源于集体审视。信任无形，却通过反复提出难题并得到诚实回答的机会逐渐建立。"},{"en":"The debate grew hectic during the electoral campaign. One candidate was accused of threatening to rig a demonstration to create havoc for her opponent; the allegation itself stirred fury. Rumors that foreign partners would conspire to hide results nearly derailed a bilateral research agreement. The director refused to portray a rival as a foe. Competition was akin to a test of institutions, she argued, not a license to abandon standards. Cosmetic improvements to the building could not repair a weak process, and relentless publicity would only make scrutiny more necessary.","zh":"选举期间，争论变得忙乱。一名候选人被指威胁操纵演示，以给对手制造混乱；指控本身便激起愤怒。有关外国合作方密谋隐瞒结果的传言，几乎破坏双边研究协议。负责人拒绝把竞争者描绘成敌人。她认为，竞争类似对制度的测试，不是放弃标准的许可。楼房表面美化无法修复薄弱程序，没完没了的宣传反而让审查更必要。"},{"en":"As election day approached, the mayor regained enough poise to speak without slogans. A patriot could question a public project, she said, and a scientist could wrestle with uncertainty without betraying science. Funding might crumble if the center overstated its abilities; disappointment would ensue even if the original intention was good. The final heading of the public report was simple: “What We Know, and What We Still Need to Test.” Under it, students could narrate their findings anew. That modest honesty was a stronger foundation than a promise of flawless progress. The council scheduled another review after the students completed their first term of work, making approval an ongoing public responsibility rather than the end of scrutiny.","zh":"选举日临近时，市长恢复了足够的镇定，不再靠口号讲话。她说，爱国者可以质疑公共项目，科学家也可以为不确定性而苦思，而不意味着背叛科学。若中心夸大能力，资金支持可能瓦解；即便最初动机很好，失望也会随之而来。公共报告最后的标题很简单：“我们知道什么，还有什么需要检验。”学生可以在这个标题下重新叙述发现。相比毫无缺陷的进步承诺，这种谦逊诚实更能打好基础。议会安排学生完成第一学期工作后再次审查，让批准成为持续的公共责任，而不是监督的终点。"}],"previous":14,"next":16});
